  "description": "The mysterious cataclysm has changed the world forever, and now people live in constant expectation of new natural disasters. But what are they caused by? What kind of higher forces decided to punish humanity? The answer knows a young man named Kuno, who was in the epicenter of the very first catastrophe. In his hands is the key to unraveling the mystery, which he forgot long ago. Now he will have to remember who he really is, and face to face with powerful beings who want to destroy humanity.",
